WEBVTT

00:15.630 --> 00:18.460
I never dreamed before

00:18.460 --> 00:21.300
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.300 --> 00:24.870
into the world of perfect free

00:24.870 --> 00:26.970
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:26.970 --> 00:29.810
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.810 --> 00:32.540
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.540 --> 00:36.110
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.110 --> 00:37.280
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.280 --> 00:40.190
I was made to hit in America

00:40.190 --> 00:43.050
(I was made to hit in America)

00:43.050 --> 00:48.960
I was made to hit in America

00:48.960 --> 00:52.630
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.630 --> 00:54.630
(To me, forever)

00:54.630 --> 00:58.340
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.340 --> 01:01.570
(To me, forever)

01:08.410 --> 01:14.020
I was made to hit in America

01:14.020 --> 01:16.860
I was made to hit in America

01:16.860 --> 01:19.720
(I was made to hit in America)

01:19.720 --> 01:22.530
I was made to hit in America

01:22.530 --> 01:25.300
(I was made to hit in America)

01:25.300 --> 01:33.170
I was made to hit in America

01:43.050 --> 01:45.120
-Over there!
-Where?! Where?!

01:45.120 --> 01:46.450
What?

01:48.250 --> 01:50.990
It's a guy!

01:50.990 --> 01:55.190
Hey...When are you gonna
introduce me to your sister?

01:57.000 --> 02:00.130
I see that you're good friends...

02:00.130 --> 02:01.030
Ouch!

02:04.340 --> 02:06.570
Ouch!

02:06.570 --> 02:10.980
Can he really sing?

02:10.980 --> 02:13.850
Well, let's get to the studio
and start our session.

02:13.850 --> 02:16.450
What? We're not going for drinks?

02:16.450 --> 02:18.220
Listen, you...

02:18.220 --> 02:20.990
Oh, well...I guess I'll
just have to belt it out.

02:20.990 --> 02:22.750
I'm looking forward to it.

02:24.160 --> 02:27.020
-Okay, okay. Well, let's go.
-Yeah...

02:29.290 --> 02:34.230
"Hyodo and the Jaguar"

02:39.260 --> 02:41.560
I think I'll get out now.

02:41.560 --> 02:42.830
Yeah...

02:45.000 --> 02:47.000
Won't you come out too, Koyuki?

02:47.000 --> 02:48.590
Yeah...

03:04.020 --> 03:05.510
Koyuki...

03:06.460 --> 03:08.220
You can have this.

03:10.290 --> 03:12.920
Why, this is...

03:14.330 --> 03:18.100
It's the pick that
Eddy of the Dying Breed used.

03:20.600 --> 03:23.640
But...isn't that important to you?

03:23.640 --> 03:30.070
I picked it up at a performance
long ago. It's my treasure.

03:34.650 --> 03:36.710
I can't accept this.

03:41.090 --> 03:43.630
Koyuki...

03:43.630 --> 03:46.030
Take good care of it!

03:54.600 --> 03:56.300
Thanks!

03:56.300 --> 03:57.790
Yeah...

04:11.550 --> 04:13.990
Sorry for calling you out so late at night.

04:13.990 --> 04:18.890
Don't worry about it.
So, what did you want?

04:18.890 --> 04:24.300
I've been thinking about the band,
and I've reached a decision.

04:24.300 --> 04:25.600
And?

04:25.600 --> 04:29.810
I've decided to join Ryusuke's band.

04:29.810 --> 04:33.400
Taira-kun...Are you serious?!

04:34.610 --> 04:39.780
I've always made decisions
based on my instincts.

04:39.780 --> 04:42.880
I've done everything I could...

04:45.290 --> 04:48.490
-It's magic...
-Magic?

04:48.490 --> 04:55.160
Ryusuke's band has the magic
I've been searching for.

04:56.470 --> 04:58.700
See you around, Eiji.

05:07.410 --> 05:11.370
Damn that Ryusuke!

05:14.720 --> 05:16.310
Damn him!

05:23.560 --> 05:26.650
-Good morning.
-Good morning.

05:31.770 --> 05:36.910
Hey, Tanaka. I see some
sort of confidence in you lately.

05:36.910 --> 05:38.770
Oh...Really?

05:38.770 --> 05:42.310
Something must have happened.
Is it a girl?

05:42.310 --> 05:46.480
A girl? No, but I have learned
how to do the butterfly kick.

05:46.480 --> 05:51.420
That girl wearing the No. 55 T-shirt
was so cute! A good singer, too!

05:51.420 --> 05:56.260
-Oh, that's Maho-chan!
-Maho?

05:56.260 --> 05:59.250
Come on! Introduce me, will you?!

06:03.270 --> 06:11.810
Nishimoto-sensei is out on maternity leave,
so here is her replacement.

06:11.810 --> 06:14.140
Uh...Ogasawara-sensei!

06:22.680 --> 06:25.050
Hello, everyone!

06:25.050 --> 06:30.320
Uh...I'm Momoko Ogasawara!
I'll be teaching music!

06:32.160 --> 06:37.430
Since we're so close in age,
you can call me Momo-chan!

06:37.430 --> 06:40.090
-Awright!
-Momo-chan!

06:48.010 --> 06:51.810
Man, that substitute is so hot!

06:51.810 --> 06:55.180
"Just call me Momo-tan!"

06:55.180 --> 06:57.290
Hey, Tanaka, are you listening?!

06:57.290 --> 06:58.910
Over there...

07:03.860 --> 07:05.880
Momo-chan!

07:07.800 --> 07:09.390
Uhh, Sensei?

07:17.070 --> 07:20.980
-I feel like giving up teaching.
-Huh?!

07:20.980 --> 07:27.450
After all, no one listens
to me during class...

07:27.450 --> 07:32.120
I was listening! Really listening!
Right, Tanaka?!

07:32.120 --> 07:35.720
I hear you're good at singing, Tanaka-kun!

07:35.720 --> 07:39.760
-Where'd you hear that?
-I heard from Nishimoto-sensei.

07:39.760 --> 07:43.730
This guy can really sing!
The other day, he...

07:43.730 --> 07:47.640
I've been put in charge of the
choir contest for the Culture Festival.

07:47.640 --> 07:49.170
That's great!

07:49.170 --> 07:54.140
I'd like you to lead
the class, Tanaka-kun!

07:54.140 --> 07:59.100
-Eh? T-Tanaka-kun...
-Leading the class?

08:05.290 --> 08:08.360
I'm counting on you!

08:08.360 --> 08:09.490
-Yes, ma'am!
-Yes, ma'am!

08:09.490 --> 08:11.360
Thank you!

08:20.900 --> 08:22.340
"Music Room"

08:20.900 --> 08:22.340
"Light Music Club"

08:22.840 --> 08:29.210
-If I could have any wish granted now,
-If I could have any wish granted now,
-If I could have any wish granted now,

08:29.210 --> 08:36.280
-I'd want wings
-I'd want wings
-I'd want wings

08:36.280 --> 08:41.820
-Say, isn't the soccer game today?
-I'm supposed to shop with Mariko!

08:41.820 --> 08:44.460
I'm sorry. I have to go.

08:44.460 --> 08:46.590
Come on! This is serious stuff!

08:46.590 --> 08:48.730
-Let's stop by Lotteria.
-Yeah!

08:48.730 --> 08:53.190
Momoko-sensei made this printout
for us! Let's memorize the lyrics-

08:58.940 --> 09:03.430
You're annoying. If you wanna
do this, why not do it yourself?

09:07.420 --> 09:10.350
Everyone...Let's practice harder tomorrow!

09:10.350 --> 09:12.720
-What a ditz!
-Who has time for this?

09:12.720 --> 09:15.890
I'll be waiting for you!

09:15.890 --> 09:17.720
I'll be waiting!

09:20.030 --> 09:22.500
Man, that was scary.

09:22.500 --> 09:26.400
If Hyodo sets his sights on you,
you're in serious trouble.

09:26.400 --> 09:29.730
If you go up against him, you're dead!

09:33.310 --> 09:36.340
Hey! Koyuki!

09:36.340 --> 09:37.830
Izumi-chan!

09:39.280 --> 09:43.590
Did you hear? Ryusuke-kun's
new band finally has a name!

09:43.590 --> 09:46.590
His new band?

09:46.590 --> 09:48.960
Would you believe...it's Beck!

09:48.960 --> 09:51.990
-His dog?
-Oh, that weird dog?

09:51.990 --> 09:54.660
Chiba-kun had the bright idea!

09:56.600 --> 09:58.800
He thought up all kinds of weird names

09:58.800 --> 10:03.440
like Blue Lightning, Naked Devils,
and Dream Travelers.

10:03.440 --> 10:06.500
-Get real!
-It's true!

10:07.540 --> 10:09.980
You want to join the Light Music Club?

10:11.210 --> 10:13.980
Maybe you shouldn't.

10:13.980 --> 10:18.850
Why not? I thought I might make
some friends I can talk music with.

10:18.850 --> 10:23.830
But I haven't heard
anything good about that club.

10:23.830 --> 10:26.520
I haven't heard a thing, either.

10:33.400 --> 10:35.200
"Music Room"

10:33.400 --> 10:35.200
"Light Music Club"

10:38.670 --> 10:44.680
"Cultural Festival"
"One Day Left"

10:44.680 --> 10:45.810
Do you think we'll be ready
in time for the festival tomorrow?

10:45.810 --> 10:47.580
Do you think we'll be ready
in time for the festival tomorrow?

10:47.580 --> 10:49.220
We'll make sure we are.

10:49.220 --> 10:51.050
Think our coffee shop will make money?

10:51.050 --> 10:53.380
No, let's offer curry!

10:57.430 --> 11:00.950
To think that no one's
practicing for tomorrow...

11:10.340 --> 11:12.030
A Jaguar!

11:17.610 --> 11:21.020
And you know...

11:21.020 --> 11:23.920
-Tanaka!
-Whattaya think you're doing?!

11:23.920 --> 11:27.160
-I'm sorry!
-I'll slap you upside your head!

11:27.160 --> 11:31.430
But...This is a Jaguar, right?

11:31.430 --> 11:34.860
A Jaguar like the one
Kurt Cobain of Nirvana used.

11:34.860 --> 11:37.260
-I've always wanted to play-
-Try playing it.

11:38.270 --> 11:40.000
You're sure?

12:18.040 --> 12:20.440
What's with your playing?!

12:20.440 --> 12:24.480
Man, I can't stop laughing!

12:24.480 --> 12:27.880
My sides hurt!

12:27.880 --> 12:32.290
Listen. How long've you been playing?

12:32.290 --> 12:36.360
Well, uh...since summer break.

12:36.360 --> 12:40.400
I'm learning from a man named Saito-san.
He loves British rock.

12:40.400 --> 12:42.730
Who the heck is Saito?

12:42.730 --> 12:48.600
If you learn from a nobody like him
you'll always be the butt of jokes.

12:53.110 --> 12:55.710
You can laugh at me all you like!

12:55.710 --> 12:59.810
But could you stop insulting Saito-san?!

12:59.810 --> 13:01.720
Huh?!

13:01.720 --> 13:05.020
You're a pain, you know? Damn you!

13:11.260 --> 13:18.400
Hey, Tanaka...Do you know
whose Jaguar that is?

13:18.400 --> 13:20.840
It wasn't my fault.

13:20.840 --> 13:24.210
-He's about to start one behind the school!
-Start one?

13:24.210 --> 13:29.800
Hey, Tanaka. I'll introduce
the owner of that Jaguar.

13:35.420 --> 13:39.720
What can I do? I don't
have what I don't have.

13:39.720 --> 13:42.860
-That guy...
-It's Yonehara-sempai.

13:42.860 --> 13:45.660
No one could beat him
when he was in elementary school.

13:49.060 --> 13:52.730
D-don't tell me that was his guitar?

13:54.770 --> 13:56.670
Screw you!

14:03.180 --> 14:05.040
Don't take me for a fool!

14:07.650 --> 14:10.550
That's Rikiya Kitazawa...
my childhood friend.

14:10.550 --> 14:11.790
Whoa...

14:11.790 --> 14:15.020
That fight was over money
borrowed for video games.

14:15.020 --> 14:17.190
-Huh?!
-Which means...

14:17.190 --> 14:22.060
What do you think'll happen
if he finds out about his Jaguar?

14:22.060 --> 14:23.430
Huh?

14:23.430 --> 14:26.530
Hey, Masaru! You were watching?

14:26.530 --> 14:29.800
No, we just happened by.

14:29.800 --> 14:32.900
Oh...Is that so?

14:52.590 --> 14:58.100
"A 14-year-old middle school student,
tired of being bullied at school,

14:58.100 --> 15:00.930
used a tri-sectional staff from China and..."

15:07.480 --> 15:12.210
I didn't tell Rikiya-kun about you, for now.

15:20.620 --> 15:22.720
Koyuki!

15:22.720 --> 15:28.030
Oh...So it is you.
What's wrong? You look pale.

15:28.030 --> 15:31.870
Yeah...But I'm fine now!

15:31.870 --> 15:34.300
Aren't you sweating a lot?

15:37.440 --> 15:40.640
Ryusuke's in a recording studio right now.

15:40.640 --> 15:42.780
Oh, with Beck?

15:42.780 --> 15:47.180
Yeah...Won't you come watch with me?

15:47.180 --> 15:51.580
But...He never wanted to see me again...

15:54.360 --> 15:56.720
Koyuki, are you hungry?

15:56.720 --> 16:02.360
I, uh, treated someone earlier,
so I'm broke...

16:02.360 --> 16:03.930
Want some fries?

16:03.930 --> 16:06.370
Oh, uh...Thanks...

16:08.470 --> 16:11.400
-Want a hamburger too?
-Yeah!

16:12.510 --> 16:16.170
Hurry up, will you?! Come on!

16:17.080 --> 16:18.670
Koyuki!

16:19.810 --> 16:23.120
I'll just take a peek from here.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.550
You serious?

16:24.550 --> 16:28.990
-Oh, that bassist-!
-Yeah. Taira-kun joined up.

16:28.990 --> 16:33.060
Seems Ryusuke and Eiji
went head to head over it.

16:33.060 --> 16:34.230
He did?

16:34.230 --> 16:37.830
Everyone looked all over for a drummer,

16:37.830 --> 16:40.840
but in the end they settled
on Togo-san of Serial Mama.

16:40.840 --> 16:43.900
Oh...That guy?

16:46.170 --> 16:48.810
They've been composing new songs,

16:48.810 --> 16:53.180
auditioning at live houses,
and sending out demo tapes.

16:57.790 --> 17:01.860
I've never seen Ryusuke so pumped up.

17:01.860 --> 17:04.830
Koyuki? What's wrong?

17:05.860 --> 17:07.190
I'm sorry!

17:10.300 --> 17:11.560
Koyuki?!

17:24.450 --> 17:27.570
I've gotta do something, too!

17:36.290 --> 17:38.630
Tanaka-kun?

17:38.630 --> 17:40.030
Momoko-sensei!

17:40.030 --> 17:44.170
It's finally time for the choir contest!

17:44.170 --> 17:48.370
I'm sorry I wasn't able to
live up to your expectations...

17:48.370 --> 17:49.640
Nonsense...

17:49.640 --> 17:52.240
Tanaka-kun...Thank you.

17:52.240 --> 17:53.310
Huh?

17:53.310 --> 17:56.280
Let's sing with all our heart!

17:56.280 --> 17:57.810
Sensei...

17:57.810 --> 17:58.800
Right!

17:59.650 --> 18:04.410
The 8th graders will sing "Give me Wings."

18:10.930 --> 18:17.700
-If I could have any wish granted now,
-If I could have any wish granted now,
-If I could have any wish granted now,

18:17.700 --> 18:30.340
-I'd want wings
-I'd want wings
-I'd want wings

18:35.280 --> 18:38.750
Man...I didn't think we'd be that bad.

18:38.750 --> 18:43.120
We came in last...
and Momoko-sensei cried...

18:44.490 --> 18:46.260
Is that a guitar?

18:52.230 --> 18:54.070
What is this?!

18:54.070 --> 18:56.130
They're having a wild time!

18:57.970 --> 19:00.810
Oh! Look at all those girls!

19:00.810 --> 19:02.470
That guitar...

19:03.380 --> 19:06.180
-It's Hyodo!
-You're right!

19:12.620 --> 19:15.280
Next year, let's do a concert...

19:18.560 --> 19:23.090
Hyodo-kun...He's really good!

19:41.880 --> 19:44.080
Hey...Tanaka.

19:45.390 --> 19:47.490
Hyodo-kun!

19:47.490 --> 19:49.520
Your live performance was great!

19:49.520 --> 19:53.130
I was practicing an imaginary guitar!

19:53.130 --> 19:58.090
Go and buy me a cola, soy milk,
a melon roll, and a curry bun.

19:59.730 --> 20:05.070
Your encore was so exciting!
Even Kazuko-sensei was dancing!

20:05.070 --> 20:08.810
Bring them to the music room ASAP.

20:08.810 --> 20:11.910
I ran into Rikiya-kun earlier.

20:11.910 --> 20:16.450
He was steaming
about the scratch on the Jaguar.

20:16.450 --> 20:19.150
He's searching all over
for the one who did it.

20:20.990 --> 20:26.290
T-that last song was
a cover of Springs, right?!

20:26.290 --> 20:32.100
Listen! I don't wanna talk music with you!

20:32.100 --> 20:35.340
If you don't want me to tell
Rikiya-kun about the scratch,

20:35.340 --> 20:38.310
you'd better hurry up and do as I say!

20:42.240 --> 20:46.610
Screw that...He can't order me around.

20:46.610 --> 20:50.610
Hey! Rikiya-sempai's started a fight!

20:55.820 --> 20:59.160
Hey, isn't that the Judo Club captain?!

21:11.070 --> 21:13.440
I'm in a bad mood today!

21:13.440 --> 21:16.670
Don't complain just because
I skipped the room-cleaning!

21:23.080 --> 21:24.520
Koyuki!

21:24.520 --> 21:27.620
Melon roll, curry bun, cola, soy milk!

21:27.620 --> 21:31.190
Melon roll, curry bun, cola, soy milk!
Melon roll, curry bun, cola, soy milk!

21:31.190 --> 21:33.090
Melon roll, curry bun, cola, soy milk!

21:33.090 --> 21:36.390
Melon roll? Weird...

21:42.200 --> 21:46.640
"Fishing Hole"

21:52.150 --> 21:56.520
This is bad! This goes
beyond being just a prank!

22:00.420 --> 22:03.220
Let's report it to the police!

22:03.220 --> 22:05.350
I know who did it.

22:06.230 --> 22:08.230
Eiji?

22:08.230 --> 22:11.200
Yeah...

22:11.200 --> 22:15.540
The day the Les Paul was stolen,
I saw his car, too.

22:15.540 --> 22:18.970
Damn! Shall we go and pulverize his Strat?!

22:22.110 --> 22:24.210
Lucille.

22:24.210 --> 22:26.480
-Huh?
-Huh?
-Huh?

22:26.480 --> 22:28.510
Lucille's the only one left.

22:34.520 --> 22:36.490
Lucille?

22:50.370 --> 22:52.470
Another minute

22:52.470 --> 22:55.170
Feelin' so fine

22:57.470 --> 22:59.710
You turn the freeze

22:59.710 --> 23:02.440
into warm light

23:04.550 --> 23:08.120
Had a premonition

23:08.120 --> 23:10.820
I've been waitin' ever since

23:10.820 --> 23:14.320
My world comin' down

23:14.320 --> 23:17.120
It's got me spinnin' 'round

23:18.900 --> 23:25.070
If you really wanna fly

23:25.070 --> 23:27.830
you gotta let go

23:40.080 --> 23:42.420
Simply the most

23:42.420 --> 23:44.450
big sensation

23:44.450 --> 23:47.260
(once you're here you won't go back)

23:47.260 --> 23:49.530
She's really pretty

23:49.530 --> 23:51.530
One-eyed vision

23:51.530 --> 23:54.360
(lose the fear it don't come back)

23:54.360 --> 23:57.870
Little sister showed me

23:57.870 --> 24:00.540
Really took me for a ride

24:00.540 --> 24:02.210
My world comin' down

24:02.210 --> 24:05.540
(once you're here you won't go back)

24:05.540 --> 24:09.570
(lose the fear it don't come back)

24:13.750 --> 24:16.290
Maybe I'll take a trip to where
the dropped pencil points.

24:16.290 --> 24:17.390
"Next Episode"

24:16.290 --> 24:17.390
"Lucille"

24:16.290 --> 24:17.390
Maybe I'll take a trip to where
the dropped pencil points.

24:17.390 --> 24:20.220
"Next Episode"

24:17.390 --> 24:20.220
"Lucille"

24:17.390 --> 24:20.220
There's sure to be a dream lying there!
